    "Name": "Thunderstone TDS-2A",
    "Details": "Earthwerks Limited attempted a more unconventional design with the -2A, using a mix of four Plasma Cannons and two MRM-30 launchers. Two Small Pulse Lasers are mounted in the arms for some extra defensive power. A total of 23 double heat sinks managed to cool this variant of the Thunderstone better than its brethren, but it still has a net negative in heat vs cooling efficiency.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.42</color></b>",
